# Prisma

- Schema: `prisma/schema.prisma` — edit here, nowhere else
- Client: import from `@/lib/prisma` (singleton)
- Dev sync: `npm run db:push`
- Prod: migrate container in `docker-compose.prod.yml`
- New models: follow existing enums (UserRole, AssignmentStatus…)
- Relations: always define both sides + onDelete where needed
- After schema change: update docs/PRODUCT.md if entities change
